# Room of Refuge's "{5}, {T}, Sacrifice this land: Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery."
# (CR 602.2b, 601.2h, 701.21a, 608.2c): the activation is not offered in the beginning of combat, the land is sacrificed as a cost
# and is in the graveyard before the ability resolves, and exactly two +1/+1 counters go on the chosen creature.
# Only a creature can be chosen (a Sol Ring is refused), an opponent's as well as one's own, and the {5} is paid in full.

